sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as System Administrator
    participant UI as Admin Web Console
    participant Ctrl as User Controller
    participant AcctSvc as AccountService
    participant UserRepo as UserRepository
    participant Audit as Logger (Audit Ledger)
    participant DB as MariaDB / MySQL

    Admin->>UI: Submit account details (Single or CSV Bulk Import)
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /admin/users/create (or /import) with CSRF
    Ctrl->>AcctSvc: createUser(data, adminId)
    
    AcctSvc->>AcctSvc: Validate Roll/Emp ID format & unique check
    AcctSvc->>UserRepo: findByIdentifier(identifier)
    UserRepo->>DB: SELECT id FROM users WHERE identifier = ?
    DB-->>UserRepo: Existing check result
    
    alt Duplicate ID found
        AcctSvc-->>Ctrl: Error: Account already exists
        Ctrl-->>UI: Display duplicate warning
    else Unique ID
        AcctSvc->>AcctSvc: generateTemporaryPassword() (Cryptographic CSPRNG)
        AcctSvc->>AcctSvc: password_hash(tempPassword, PASSWORD_DEFAULT)
        AcctSvc->>UserRepo: create(user fields + hash + must_change_password=1)
        UserRepo->>DB: INSERT INTO users VALUES (...)
        DB-->>UserRepo: Insert ID
        
        AcctSvc->>Audit: audit("ACCOUNT_CREATED", userId)
        Audit->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (details without password)
        
        AcctSvc-->>Ctrl: Success + temporary password (Plain shown once)
        Ctrl-->>UI: Display credentials card / download list
        UI-->>Admin: Secure handoff of initial credential
    end
